      "role": "user",
      "content": "interesting. so when you say \"unrefined\" or \"raw\" in relation to those specific demographics, do you mean that the cultural values themselves are less sophisticated, or is it just a perception issue? like, is there a reason why certain cultural expressions are inherently seen as \"lower class\" compared to, say, European-style minimalist trends?",
